// ==========================================
// 01: STARTER BEATS (Tidal Mini-Notation)
// ==========================================
// Instructions:
// 1. Launch with `:StrudelLaunch` (or <leader>ml)
// 2. Play / Pause with `:StrudelToggle` (or <leader>mp)
// 3. Edit code, then `:StrudelUpdate` (or <leader>mu) to hear your changes!

// 1. Basic four-on-the-floor kick pattern
s("bd bd bd bd")

// Try uncommenting different patterns below to experiment:

// 2. Kick + Snare + Hi-hat:
// s("bd [~ sd] bd [sd hh]")

// 3. Hi-hat subdivisions (*4 repeats 4 times in the step):
// s("bd [~ sd] bd [sd hh*4]")

// 4. Using rests (~) and claps (cp):
// s("[bd ~ bd ~] [~ cp ~ cp]")

// 5. Changing playback speed:
// s("bd [sd hh] bd [sd*2 hh*2]").cpm(130)
